  "The dense black CDF series (Fig17: 2324 points; Fig22: 1805 points) have small local zig-zags from the nearest-point pairing: 8 and 5 non-monotone steps, with drops of up to 0.005 in F. They are harmless for the statistics but are not strictly monotone.",
  "series[2] derived_statistics F_at_end = 1.0, but the last point is 0.99849 at x = 2.006 (cosmetic).",
